@startuml
title Prompt 变更按软件版本发布

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "变更集\nsystem prompt / template / tool schemas\nretrieval policy / model snapshot" as change #E0F2FE
rectangle "不可变 Bundle\ncontent hash + version + owner" as bundle
rectangle "离线回归\n能力、拒答、安全、成本" as offline
rectangle "影子与灰度\n固定分流 + 旧新双记录" as canary #FEF3C7
rectangle "版本别名\nprod -> bundle_v18" as alias #DCFCE7
rectangle "回滚\nprod -> bundle_v17" as rollback #FEE2E2

change --> bundle
bundle --> offline
offline --> canary
canary --> alias : 达标
alias --> rollback : 线上守门指标退化

note right of bundle
  Prompt 不是唯一变量；
  运行时组合必须一起冻结
end note
@enduml
